# Compiler and/or linker options can be added here to add to (or override) those
# added automatically by Kitsune for the 'serial' tapir target. 
#
# Other options can be added here as well, but any options not exclusively
# intended for the 'serial' tapir target should be added to the frontend config
# files (${KITSUNE_C_FRONTEND}.cfg, ${KITSUNE_CXX_FRONTEND}.cfg, ${KITSUNE_Fortran_FRONTEND}.cfg).
#
# See clang's documentation for details on the config files.